Optimise conversion of HTTP/2 header field names to lower case

HpackEncoder.encode() already lower-cases header names, so the
HPACK writers no longer lower-case them again. No change for Tomcat's
own response encoding; lets tests send upper case field names.

Upstream: 7b51ac0f20 (9.0.x, 9.0.118); prerequisite of cf9452443b
  (CVE-2026-41293). changelog.xml hunk dropped.

Backported for CIQ LTS 9.6 (tomcat 9.0.87.redhat-00013).

